Notes:
- When item/value is an OBJECT, include all listed "required" keys when creating it.
- Arrays/maps may enforce limits (uniqueItems, min/max counts) and map keys may have regex constraints.
- For topics, "value" may be a string (description) or a full node {description?, subtopics?}.
